Package: HydroPonicsK
Type: Package
Title: Hydroponic Data Analysis Tools
Version: 1.0.3
Authors@R: person("Khalid Ul Islam", "Rather", email = "drkhalidulislam@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides statistical and graphical tools for
    the analysis of hydroponic crop production data. The package includes
    functions for descriptive statistical analysis, data visualization,
    correlation analysis, heatmap generation, and graphical summaries of
    plant growth and nutrient-related variables. These tools support
    researchers, students, and practitioners in evaluating crop
    performance and environmental conditions in hydroponic cultivation
    systems. The package utilizes standard statistical methods implemented
    in R for data exploration and visualization. Methods are described in
    James et al. (2021, ISBN:9781071614172) and Wickham (2016,
    ISBN:9783319242750).
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
